{"type":"standard","title":"Victor Marx","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Victor Marx</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q136433534","titles":{"canonical":"Victor_Marx","normalized":"Victor Marx","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Victor Marx</span></span>"},"pageid":83260970,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Victor_Marx_%2852125665777%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Victor_Marx_%2852125665777%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":436},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/79/Victor_Marx_%2852125665777%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1145,"height":1514},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1379358694","tid":"8ddb0a12-c3e7-11f1-9ccb-d47b7d105c78","timestamp":"2026-10-09T13:44:31Z","description":"American political candidate (born 1965)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victor_Marx","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victor_Marx?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victor_Marx?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Victor_Marx"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victor_Marx","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Victor_Marx","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victor_Marx?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Victor_Marx"}},"extract":"Victor Marx is an American author, minister, and political candidate. He is the Republican nominee for governor of Colorado in the 2026 election, where he will face the Democratic nominee Phil Weiser. Marx has made several claims about his life and background that have been seen as sensational and controversial, while the validity of many of his claims has been questioned or disproven.","extract_html":"<p><b>Victor Marx</b> is an American author, minister, and political candidate. He is the Republican nominee for governor of Colorado in the 2026 election, where he will face the Democratic nominee Phil Weiser. Marx has made several claims about his life and background that have been seen as sensational and controversial, while the validity of many of his claims has been questioned or disproven.</p>"}